{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-feedbacks-api-01",
    "name": "Feedbacks API — Módulo 01 (Auth)",
    "description": "Collection da API Quarkus (feedbacks-api).\n\n**Como usar**\n1. Suba a API em `http://localhost:8080` (profile `local`).\n2. Rode **Auth → Login (Estudante)** ou **Login (Admin)** — o script salva `accessToken` automaticamente.\n3. As rotas protegidas usam `Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}`.\n\n**Usuários seed (Flyway V2)**\n- Estudante: `estudante@demo.fiap` / `senha123`\n- Admin: `admin@demo.fiap` / `admin123`",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080"
    },
    {
      "key": "accessToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "cursoId",
      "value": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111"
    },
    {
      "key": "aulaId",
      "value": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222"
    }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{accessToken}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /api/v1/health",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/health",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "health"]
            },
            "description": "Health público do contrato (AD-9). Sem token."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /q/health (SmallRye)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/q/health",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["q", "health"]
            },
            "description": "Health nativo SmallRye (liveness/readiness agregados)."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login (Estudante)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', json.accessToken);",
                  "  console.log('accessToken salvo (ESTUDANTE)');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"estudante@demo.fiap\",\n  \"password\": \"senha123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Login público. Em sucesso, grava `accessToken` na collection."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Login (Admin)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', json.accessToken);",
                  "  console.log('accessToken salvo (ADMINISTRADOR)');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@demo.fiap\",\n  \"password\": \"admin123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Login como ADMINISTRADOR. Grava `accessToken` na collection."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Login — credenciais inválidas (401)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"estudante@demo.fiap\",\n  \"password\": \"senha-errada\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Esperado: 401 com `code` = `AUTH_INVALID_CREDENTIALS` e `traceId`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Login — validação (400)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"nao-e-email\",\n  \"password\": \"123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Esperado: 400 com `code` = `VALIDATION_ERROR`."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Cursos",
